          "type": "text",
          "text": " <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>VIOLET CABINET — 修鞋与配钥匙预约</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --paper: #AE8ECD;\n      --ink: #241A2E;\n      --ink-soft: #3A2C4C;\n      --tab: #452F5A;\n      --rule: #513868;\n      --paper-deep: #9B78BE;\n      --ink-mid: #2C2038;\n      --gap: 18px;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html {\n      background: var(--paper);\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      background: var(--paper);\n      font-family: \"Noto Serif SC\", Literata, Georgia, serif;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n\n    button,\n    input {\n      font: inherit;\n    }\n\n    button {\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      padding: 28px 38px 34px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n\n    .masthead {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;\n      align-items: start;\n      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rule);\n      padding-bottom: 14px;\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(4px);\n      animation: meta-in 220ms ease-out 165ms forwards;\n    }\n\n    .brand,\n    .meta,\n    .eyebrow,\n    h1,\n    h2,\n    h3,\n    .drawer-label,\n    .number,\n    .button {\n      font-family: Jost, \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      letter-spacing: .16em;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .mast-center {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      letter-spacing: .12em;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .meta {\n      justify-self: end;\n      text-align: right;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .1em;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.45fr) minmax(250px, .55fr);\n      gap: 42px;\n      align-items: end;\n      padding: 30px 0 26px;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      letter-spacing: .22em;\n      color: var(--tab);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      max-width: 760px;\n      font-size: clamp(58px, 8.2vw, 100px);\n      line-height: .9;\n      letter-spacing: -.055em;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .hero-note {\n      border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);\n      padding: 4px 0 4px 18px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      max-width: 300px;\n    }\n\n    .hero-note strong {\n      display: block;\n      color: var(--ink);\n      font-family: Jost, \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .cabinet {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 118px 1fr;\n      align-items: start;\n      border-top: 2px solid var(--rule);\n      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rule);\n    }\n\n    .drawer-rail {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 15px 0;\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label {\n      position: relative;\n      border: 2px solid var(--rule);\n      border-left: 0;\n      background: var(--paper-deep);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      text-align: left;\n      padding: 13px 9px 12px 13px;\n      min-height: 50px;\n      letter-spacing: .09em;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      transition:\n        border-color 120ms ease-out,\n        background-color 120ms ease-out,\n        transform 220ms ease-out;\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label[data-width=\"74\"] {\n      width: 74px;\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label[data-width=\"96\"] {\n      width: 96px;\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label[data-width=\"118\"] {\n      width: 118px;\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label[aria-selected=\"true\"] {\n      background: var(--tab);\n      color: var(--paper);\n      border-color: var(--tab);\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label.notched::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -2px;\n      right: 15px;\n      width: 6px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: var(--paper);\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label:focus-visible,\n    .button:focus-visible {\n      outline: 2px solid var(--ink);\n      outline-offset: 3px;\n    }\n\n    .drawer-content {\n      min-width: 0;\n      padding: 15px 0 20px 24px;\n    }\n\n    .panel {\n      display: none;\n    }\n\n    .panel.active {\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .panel-head {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: baseline;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 18px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding: 0 0 10px;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n    }\n\n    .condition {\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .cards {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.12fr .88fr;\n      gap: var(--gap);\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      min-height: 188px;\n      border: 2px solid var(--rule);\n      padding: 16px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr;\n      gap: 16px;\n      background: var(--paper);\n    }\n\n    .card:nth-child(2) {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 96px;\n      min-height: 164px;\n    }\n\n    .card:nth-child(2) .number {\n      grid-column: 2;\n      grid-row: 1;\n    }\n\n    .card:nth-child(2) .card-copy {\n      grid-column: 1;\n      grid-row: 1;\n    }\n\n    .number {\n      font-size: 30px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      color: var(--tab);\n      letter-spacing: -.04em;\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding-right: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .card:nth-child(2) .number {\n      border-right: 0;\n      border-left: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding: 0 0 0 12px;\n    }\n\n    .card h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      letter-spacing: .04em;\n    }\n\n    .card p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .card small {\n      display: block;\n      margin-top: 13px;\n      color: var(--tab);\n      font-family: Jost, \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      letter-spacing: .1em;\n      font-size: 11px;\n    }\n\n    .card-visual {\n      grid-column: 1 / -1;\n      margin-top: 14px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding-top: 9px;\n    }\n\n    .card-visual img {\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: auto;\n      aspect-ratio: 4 / 1.35;\n      object-fit: cover;\n      border: 0;\n    }\n\n    .key-list,\n    .consult-list {\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .key-item,\n    .consult-item {\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      padding: 5px 0 12px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr;\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .key-item:last-child,\n    .consult-item:last-child {\n      border-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .key-item .number,\n    .consult-item .number {\n      border: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-size: 25px;\n    }\n\n    .key-item h3,\n    .consult-item h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 4px;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .key-item p,\n    .consult-item p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .actions {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: end;\n      gap: 20px;\n      padding-top: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .actions-note {\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .button {\n      display: inline-block;\n      border: 2px solid var(--rule);\n      background: var(--paper);\n      color: var(--ink);\n      padding: 11px 18px 10px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      letter-spacing: .1em;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      transition:\n        border-color 120ms ease-out,\n        padding 80ms ease-out;\n    }\n\n    .button:hover {\n      border-color: var(--tab);\n    }\n\n    .button:active {\n      padding: 12px 19px 9px 17px;\n    }\n\n    .footer {\n      margin-top: auto;\n      padding-top: 18px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 20px;\n      color: var(--ink-soft);\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .footer .numberline {\n      font-family: Jost, \"Noto Sans SC\", sans-serif;\n      letter-spacing: .09em;\n      color: var(--tab);\n    }\n\n    @keyframes meta-in {\n      to {\n        opacity: 1;\n        transform: translateY(0);\n      }\n    }\n\n    @keyframes pull {\n      to {\n        opacity: 1;\n        transform: translateX(6px);\n      }\n    }\n\n    .drawer-label.reveal {\n      animation: pull 220ms ease-out forwards;\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n      .masthead {\n        animation: none;\n        opacity: 1;\n        transform: none;\n      }\n\n      .drawer-label.reveal {\n        animation: none;\n        transform: none;\n      }\n\n      .drawer-label[data-width=\"74\"] {\n        width: 78px;\n      }\n\n      .drawer-label[data-width=\"96\"] {\n        width: 100px;\n      }\n\n      .drawer-label[data-width=\"118\"] {\n        width: 122px;\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 760px) {\n      .page {\n        padding: 20px 18px 24px;\n      }\n\n      .masthead {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;\n      }\n\n      .mast-center {\n        display: none;\n      }\n\n      .hero {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        gap: 22px;\n        padding: 25px 0 22px;\n      }\n\n      h1 {\n        font-size: clamp(55px, 17vw, 84px);\n      }\n\n      .hero-note {\n        max-width: none;\n      }\n\n      .cabinet {\n        grid-template-columns: 96px 1fr;\n      }\n\n      .drawer-content {\n        padding-left: 16px;\n      }\n\n      .cards {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n\n      .card,\n      .card:nth-child(2) {\n        grid-template-columns: 74px 1fr;\n        min-height: 0;\n      }\n\n      .card:nth-child(2) .number,\n      .card:nth-child(2) .card-copy {\n        grid-column: auto;\n        grid-row: auto;\n      }\n\n      .card:nth-child(2) .number {\n        border-left: 0;\n        border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);\n        padding: 0 12px 0 0;\n      }\n\n      .actions,\n      .footer {\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        flex-direction: column;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"masthead\" aria-label=\"店铺信息\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">VIOLET CABINET / 78</div>\n      <div class=\"mast-center\">鞋履 · 钥匙 · 预约制</div>\n      <div class=\"meta\">开放日<br>MON—SAT / 10:00—19:00</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Private service index / 预约索引</p>\n        <h1 id=\"title\">把日常<br>修成少见。</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-note\">\n        <strong>先选通道，再交给我们。</strong>\n        这里没有货架，只有三只抽屉。请先告诉我，您今天要处理的是鞋、钥匙，还是一件需要当面判断的事。\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"cabinet\" aria-label=\"服务通道\">\n      <nav class=\"drawer-rail\" aria-label=\"选择服务通道\">\n        <button class=\"drawer-label reveal\" data-width=\"74\" data-panel=\"repair\" aria-selected=\"true\">A-101<br>鞋履修复</button>\n        <button class=\"drawer-label reveal\" data-width=\"96\" data-panel=\"keys\" aria-selected=\"false\">B-102<br>钥匙配制</button>\n        <button class=\"drawer-label reveal notched\" data-width=\"118\" data-panel=\"consult\" aria-selected=\"false\">C-104<br>预约咨询</button>\n      </nav>\n\n      <div class=\"drawer-content\">\n        <section class=\"panel active\" id=\"repair\" aria-label=\"鞋履修复清单\">\n          <div class=\"panel-head\">\n            <h2>A-101 / 鞋履修复</h2>\n            <span class=\"condition\">适合：有故事，仍想再穿很久</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"cards\">\n            <article class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"number\">A-101</div>\n              <div class=\"card-copy\">\n                <h3>皮面复原</h3>\n                <p>擦伤、褪色与旧痕交给我。保留皮革的年轮，不把它做成刚买来的样子。</p>\n                <small>需带实物判断 · 约 2—5 日</small>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-visual\">\n                <img src=\"images/占位-1.jpg\" width=\"640\" height=\"216\" alt=\"皮革修复工序细节\">\n              </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"card\">\n              <div class=\"number\">A-103</div>\n              <div class=\"card-copy\">\n                <h3>鞋底与跟部</h3>\n                <p>稳住脚下的分寸。换底、补跟、加固，先看走路方式，再决定材料。</p>\n                <small>需提前预约 · 约 3—7 日</small>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <span class=\"actions-note\">预约时请告知品牌、材质与希望取件日期。</span>\n            <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:13800138000\">电话预约　138 0013 8000</a>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel\" id=\"keys\" aria-label=\"钥匙配制清单\">\n          <div class=\"panel-head\">\n            <h2>B-102 / 钥匙配制</h2>\n            <span class=\"condition\">适合：需要准确，不接受将就</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"key-list\">\n            <article class=\"key-item\">\n              <div class=\"number\">B-102</div>\n              <div>\n                <h3>住宅钥匙</h3>\n                <p>常规门锁、老式锁芯与备用钥匙。请带原钥匙，现场核对齿形。</p>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"key-item\">\n              <div class=\"number\">B-105</div>\n              <div>\n                <h3>特殊钥匙</h3>\n                <p>汽车、信箱与异形钥匙，先电话确认型号与库存，再为您留出时间。</p>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <span class=\"actions-note\">复杂齿形不做盲配，准确比速度更体面。</span>\n            <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:13800138000\">电话确认　138 0013 8000</a>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"panel\" id=\"consult\" aria-label=\"预约咨询清单\">\n          <div class=\"panel-head\">\n            <h2>C-104 / 预约咨询</h2>\n            <span class=\"condition\">适合：不确定，也值得先聊一聊</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"consult-list\">\n            <article class=\"consult-item\">\n              <div class=\"number\">C-104</div>\n              <div>\n                <h3>到店判断</h3>\n                <p>带上鞋或锁来。我们当面决定是否值得修、如何修，以及什么时候取回最合适。</p>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <span class=\"actions-note\">每天只留少量咨询时段，让判断不被催促。</span>\n            <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:13800138000\">预约时段　138 0013 8000</a>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span>不做网店，只做预约制的手上功夫。</span>\n      <span class=\"numberline\">A-101　B-102　C-104 / EAST DISTRICT</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (() => {\n      const tabs = [...document.querySelectorAll(\".drawer-label\")];\n      const panels = [...document.querySelectorAll(\".panel\")];\n\n      tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n        tab.style.animationDelay = `${index * 55}ms`;\n\n        tab.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n          tabs.forEach((item) => {\n            item.setAttribute(\"aria-selected\", String(item === tab));\n          });\n\n          panels.forEach((panel) => {\n            panel.classList.toggle(\"active\", panel.id === tab.dataset.panel);\n          });\n        });\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>"
        }
      }
    }
  },
